{"id":156,"date":"2009-01-18T10:53:24","date_gmt":"2009-01-18T10:53:24","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=156"},"modified":"2015-04-24T23:21:14","modified_gmt":"2015-04-24T22:21:14","slug":"festival-de-robotique-photos-de-michel-vonlanthen","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2009\/01\/18\/festival-de-robotique-photos-de-michel-vonlanthen\/","title":{"rendered":"Festival de robotique &#8211; photos de Michel Vonlanthen"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Michel Vonlanthen a (enfin!) publi\u00e9 ses photos lors du festival de robotique 2008 de l&rsquo;EPFL. Elles sont visibles en commen\u00e7ant ici: <a href=\"http:\/\/www.hb9afo.ch\/blog\/20080419_epfl_festival%20robotique\/robotique.gif\" target=\"_blank\">http:\/\/www.hb9afo.ch\/blog\/20080419_epfl_festival%20robotique\/robotique.gif<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Et ensuite, le chargement de la suivante se fait en diaporama. Elle sont repr\u00e9sentatives de l&rsquo;ensemble de la manifestation, qui avait eu un succ\u00e8s m\u00e9rit\u00e9. Merci Michel pour ces vues!\u00a0 <em>Et un conseil en passant: utilise plut\u00f4t <a title=\"jalbum\" href=\"http:\/\/jalbum.net\/\">Jalbum<\/a> pour cr\u00e9er tes albums WEB&#8230;<\/em> <em>il fait tout: imagettes, r\u00e9duction, mise en page, navigation, skin, etc, etc!<\/em><\/p>\n<p>Yves Masur<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Michel Vonlanthen a (enfin!) publi\u00e9 ses photos lors du festival de robotique 2008 de l&rsquo;EPFL. Elles sont visibles en commen\u00e7ant<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":37,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[5,11,13,19,23,25],"class_list":["post-156","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-epfl","tag-hardware","tag-initiation","tag